---
import OptimizedImage from "../../../components/OptimizedImage.astro";
---
<div class="w-full"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/5109733ee0bf.webp" alt="表紙" width="2560" height="1020" class="block w-full h-auto" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" /></div>

    <article class="px-6 mb:px-16 dt:px-35 pt-10">
      <header>
        <h1 class="font-extrabold text-2xl mb:text-[32px] leading-10">ひかりのぼうけん - 2024</h1>
        <p class="mt-1 font-extrabold text-[18px] mb:text-2xl leading-8 font-jp">ひかりのぼうけん</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[18px] leading-6 font-medium">文・イラスト：Thuy An</p>
      </header>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word">この絵本は、日本の桜の季節への憧れから生まれました。淡いピンク色に包まれた桜の世界に浸ることをずっと夢見ていて、その夢がやがてこの物語のインスピレーションになりました。</p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word">お母さんが夕食の準備を終えるのを待つ間、小さな冒険に出かける男の子のお話です。ただの散歩のはずだったのに、それは短いけれど不思議な旅になり——家に帰った男の子は、お母さんにささやかなお土産を持ち帰ります。</p>

      <section class="mt-14 mb:mt-16" aria-label="作品">
        <h2 class="sr-only">作品</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 dt:grid-cols-2 gap-10 mb:gap-12.5 items-start">
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/b8ee8d0cfdc1.webp" alt="作品 1" width="1200" height="952" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/ecc1bf98e159.webp" alt="作品 2" width="1200" height="961" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/73d030cc59cf.webp" alt="作品 3" width="1200" height="973" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/bd3e0da34856.webp" alt="作品 4" width="1200" height="1007" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="dt:col-span-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-250"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/7b0db76a95c4.webp" alt="作品 5" width="2200" height="1267" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="dt:col-span-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-250"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/08936063d072.webp" alt="作品 6" width="2200" height="869" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        </div>
        </section>

      <div class="mt-18 mb:mt-22 flex flex-col items-center gap-10 mb:gap-11">
        <OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/f4de69732cf5.webp" alt="締めくくりのイラスト" width="586" height="510" class="block w-50 h-50 mb:w-62.5 mb:h-62.5 rounded-full object-cover object-center mx-auto" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <p class="font-extrabold text-2xl mb:text-[32px] leading-10 text-center">ご覧いただき、ありがとうございました！</p>
      </div>

      <a href="/jp/illustration" id="back-link" class="img-btn block w-34 h-6.5 mt-17 mb-21 bg-left!" style="background-image:url(/assets/icons/back.png)" aria-label="もどる" title="もどる"></a>
    </article>
